# Enemy prototype: the enemy attacks monsters in attack position (decided 2026-10-06).
#   equal ATK: the player's monster is destroyed, the enemy loses that monster's ATK in HP
#   lower ATK: the player's monster survives, the enemy loses the difference in HP
# The enemy is destroyed by battle only at HP 0; the player takes no damage. TEST VALUES.
start_draw 0 0
start_draw 1 0
draw_per_turn 1 0
card 0 mzone 5628232        # Flying Penguin 1200 (same ATK as the enemy)
card 0 mzone 69247929       # Gene-Warped Warwolf 2000
card 0 deck 15025844 x10
card 1 mzone 990000001 fu_atk

0 idle end
1 idle battle
1 battle attack 990000001
1 select 5628232            # 1200 vs 1200
expect cards 0 grave 5628232
expect hp 990000001 2000 3200
expect count 1 mzone 1
expect destroyed 990000001 not destroyed
expect lp 0 8000
1 battle end
0 idle end
1 idle battle
1 battle attack 990000001
1 select 69247929           # 1200 vs 2000: HP -800, Warwolf survives
expect hp 990000001 1200
expect count 0 mzone 1
expect count 1 mzone 1
expect lp 0 8000
stop
